   "xml_name": "PS5_001_Function Shirt Size",
   "display_name": "Shirt Size",
   "questiontext_html": "<p>A shop chooses a shirt size from the chest measurement in cm:</p>\n<ul><li><b>S</b>: below 90</li><li><b>M</b>: 90 to 99 (both included)</li><li><b>L</b>: 100 to 109 (both included)</li><li><b>XL</b>: 110 or more</li></ul>\n<p>Write a function <code>shirt_size(chest)</code> that takes a chest measurement (a positive integer, int &gt; 0) and <b>returns</b> the size as a string: <code>\"S\"</code>, <code>\"M\"</code>, <code>\"L\"</code> or <code>\"XL\"</code>.</p>\n<p><b>Examples:</b> <code>shirt_size(85)</code> returns <code>\"S\"</code>. <code>shirt_size(90)</code> returns <code>\"M\"</code>. <code>shirt_size(110)</code> returns <code>\"XL\"</code>.</p>",
