   "display_name": "Middle Of Three",
   "questiontext_html": "<p>Write a function <code>middle_of_three(a, b, c)</code> that takes three integers and <b>returns</b> the middle one: the value that would be in the middle if you wrote the three numbers in increasing order. If two or more of them are equal, the middle value is still one of them (for example, the middle of 4, 4 and 1 is 4).</p>\n<p><b>Examples:</b> <code>middle_of_three(3, 9, 5)</code> returns <code>5</code>. <code>middle_of_three(10, 2, 7)</code> returns <code>7</code>. <code>middle_of_three(4, 4, 1)</code> returns <code>4</code>. <code>middle_of_three(6, 6, 6)</code> returns <code>6</code>.</p>",
