   "display_name": "Sum Of Multiples",
   "questiontext_html": "<p>Write a function <code>sum_of_multiples(n, k)</code> that takes two positive integers (int &gt; 0) <code>n</code> and <code>k</code>, and <b>returns</b> the sum of all the multiples of <code>k</code> from 1 to <code>n</code> (both included).</p>\n<p><b>Examples:</b> <code>sum_of_multiples(10, 3)</code> returns <code>18</code> (3 + 6 + 9). <code>sum_of_multiples(10, 5)</code> returns <code>15</code> (5 + 10). <code>sum_of_multiples(4, 7)</code> returns <code>0</code> (there are no multiples of 7 up to 4).</p>",
