   "questiontext_html": "<p>Write a recursive function <code>largest_digit(n)</code> that takes a positive integer (int &gt; 0) <code>n</code> and <b>returns</b> its largest digit.</p>\n<p>Your function <b>must be recursive</b> (it must call itself), and must <b>not</b> use any loop.</p>\n<p><b>Examples:</b> <code>largest_digit(4729)</code> returns <code>9</code>. <code>largest_digit(5)</code> returns <code>5</code>. <code>largest_digit(1000)</code> returns <code>1</code>.</p>",
